    "chunk_text": "on a: hic draco \u00fees draca huius draconis, And ealle \u00f0as naman habba\u00f0 langne o on eallum casum and macia\u00f0 heora ablativvm on scortne e: ab \u00deas o\u00f0re habba\u00f0 scortne i for \u00f0am langan o on eallum casum: hic et haec homo, huius hominis; nemo nan man ys eac commvnis generis, neminis nanes mannes, nemini, neminem nis \u00f0ar nan \u00d0as o\u00f0re synd FEMININI GENERIS: haec uirgo \u00f0is m\u00e6den, huius uirginis; fuligo sot, caligo Sume of \u00f0isum syndon MASCVLINI GENERIS: hic cardo \u00feeos heorr, huius cardinis; ordo On langne o geendia\u00f0 grecisce naman FEMININI GENERIS and synd agene naman: haec Dido anes IN AL CORREPTAM. On scortne al ys an nama MASCVLINI GENERIS: hic sal \u00feis sealt, huius salis, and PROPRIA \u00dea o\u00f0re synd NEVTRI GENERIS: hoc tribunal \u00feis domsetl, huius tribunalis; calcar spura, uectigal And \u00f0as NEVTRI GENERIS habba\u00f0 langne a on eallum casum and macia\u00f0 ABLATIVVM on langne IN EL CORREPTAM. On scortne el geendia\u00f0 NEVTRI GENERIS hoc mel \u00feis hunig, huius mellis ABLATIVVM on e: ab IN EL PRODVCTAM. On langne el synd agene naman MASCVLINI: hic Daniel, huius Danielis; Michael, Gabriel, \u00d0as habba\u00f0 langne e on eallum casum and hi geendia\u00f0 heora ABLATIVVM on scortne e, swaswa IN IL CORREPTAM. On scortne il geendia\u00f0 hic pugil \u00f0es beatere; hic mugil \u00fees",
